# 4. P0 — Permission / Sandbox / Process

## 4.1 Capability-Based Permissions

* [ ] Enable Capability Model as the primary permission system
* [ ] Tool Capability
* [ ] File Capability
* [ ] Command Capability
* [ ] MCP Capability
* [ ] Sub-agent Capability
* [ ] Capability Scope
* [ ] Permission Denied Result
* [ ] Permission Audit

Example:

```text
write_file
    ↓
Scope:
/project/**
```

Instead of:

```text
write_file
    ↓
Full filesystem access
```

## 4.2 Sandbox

* [ ] Linux Landlock integration
* [ ] Filesystem Scope enforcement
* [ ] Symlink protection
* [ ] Path Traversal protection
* [ ] Sandbox Escape Tests
* [ ] Grandchild Process Escape Tests
* [ ] Sandbox Failure Handling

## 4.3 Process Manager

* [ ] Process Spawn
* [ ] Process Group
* [ ] Child Process Tracking
* [ ] Grandchild Process Tracking
* [ ] SIGTERM handling
* [ ] Grace Period
* [ ] SIGKILL fallback
* [ ] Zombie Process Reaping
* [ ] CPU Limits
* [ ] Memory Limits
* [ ] Process Limits
* [ ] Resource Cleanup

### Final Execution Chain

```text
Agent
 ↓
Permission
 ↓
Capability Scope
 ↓
Sandbox
 ↓
Process Manager
 ↓
Tool
 ↓
OS
```

