# 5. P0 — Scheduler

## 5.1 Task Scheduler

* [ ] Priority Queue
* [ ] Task State Management
* [ ] Task Dependencies
* [ ] Task Cancellation
* [ ] Cascading Cancellation
* [ ] Retry
* [ ] Backoff
* [ ] Timeout
* [ ] Graceful Shutdown
* [ ] Process-wide Concurrency Quota

## 5.2 Task Lifecycle

```text
Created
  ↓
Queued
  ↓
Running
  ↓
Waiting
  ↓
Running
  ↓
Completed
```

Failure flow:

```text
Running
   ↓
Failed
   ↓
Retry
   ↓
Running
```

Cancellation flow:

```text
Running
   ↓
Cancelled
```

