# 6. P1 — Sub-agent Runtime

## 6.1 Actor Model

* [ ] Sub-agent Actor
* [ ] Independent lifecycle
* [ ] Independent state
* [ ] Independent cancellation
* [ ] Independent timeout
* [ ] Independent error handling
* [ ] Error isolation
* [ ] Capability isolation
* [ ] Concurrency limits
* [ ] Quota control

## 6.2 Sub-agent Scheduling

```text
Main Agent
     │
     ▼
Scheduler
 ┌───┼────┐
 ↓   ↓    ↓
Explore Plan Coder
 │    │    │
Actor Actor Actor
```

Sub-agents must not automatically inherit elevated capabilities from the Main Agent.

## 6.3 Sub-agent Results

* [ ] Standardized Result
* [ ] Error Result
* [ ] Partial Result
* [ ] Cancellation Result
* [ ] Runtime Events
* [ ] UI State Synchronization

