# 9. P1 — Agent Loop Stability

## 9.1 Stop Policy

* [ ] Max Turns
* [ ] Max Tool Calls
* [ ] Task Timeout
* [ ] Runtime Timeout
* [ ] User Cancellation

## 9.2 Doom Loop Detection

Detect:

* [ ] Repeated Tool Calls
* [ ] Repeated Calls with Identical Arguments
* [ ] Repeated Resource Access
* [ ] Repeated Searches
* [ ] Equivalent Paths
* [ ] Repeated Equivalent Operations

Recommended escalation:

```text
First occurrence
 ↓
Reminder

Repeated occurrence
 ↓
Warning

Continued repetition
 ↓
Stop
```

## 9.3 Error Recovery

* [ ] Empty Model Response
* [ ] Invalid Tool Call
* [ ] Tool Failure
* [ ] Model Failure
* [ ] MCP Failure
* [ ] Runtime Failure
* [ ] Process Failure
* [ ] IPC Failure

