## 10.3 Runtime Crash Recovery

* [ ] Electron detects Runtime status
* [ ] Runtime crash detection
* [ ] Runtime restart
* [ ] Task recovery
* [ ] IPC reconnect
* [ ] UI state restoration

Target:

```text
Electron Crash
      ↓
Rust Runtime
      ↓
Continue / Recover Task
```

The Runtime should not depend on the Electron UI remaining alive.

