# 15. Final 2.0 Architecture Acceptance

The final architecture should be:

```text
                  User
                   │
                   ▼
             Electron UI
                   │
                  IPC
                   │
                   ▼
          Rust Agent Runtime
                   │
        ┌──────────┼──────────┐
        ▼          ▼          ▼
     Agent      Scheduler   Context
      Core
        │
        ▼
       Tool
        │
   ┌────┼─────┐
   ▼    ▼     ▼
Permission Sandbox Process
   │    │     │
   └────┼─────┘
        ▼
   Tool / MCP
        │
        ▼
        OS
```

The following must be true:

* [ ] Agent execution is controlled by Rust Runtime
* [ ] Tool execution is controlled by Rust Runtime
* [ ] Permission is enforced by Runtime
* [ ] Sandbox is enforced by Runtime
* [ ] Processes are managed by Runtime
* [ ] Scheduler manages Tasks
* [ ] Scheduler manages Sub-agents
* [ ] MCP is managed by Runtime
* [ ] Context State can be persisted
* [ ] Compaction preserves critical task state
* [ ] Electron does not directly control core Agent execution
* [ ] Runtime can recover from crashes
* [ ] Core execution behavior is auditable
* [ ] Security Tests pass
* [ ] Long-running Agent Tests pass

